    "requires": "A C++26 compiler, a built darker-cpp checkout at the recorded revision, original game archives, and a lossless PPM-to-PNG encoder.",
    "build": "c++ -std=c++2c -O2 -I \"$ENGINE/src\" -I \"$ENGINE\" scripts/render-graphics-figures.cpp -Wl,--start-group \"$ENGINE/build-relwithdebinfo/libdarker_graphics.a\" \"$ENGINE/build-relwithdebinfo/libdarker_game.a\" \"$ENGINE/build-relwithdebinfo/libdarker_maths.a\" \"$ENGINE/build-relwithdebinfo/libdarker_resources.a\" \"$ENGINE/build-relwithdebinfo/libframework_core.a\" -Wl,--end-group -o /tmp/darker-graphics-figures",
    "run": "/tmp/darker-graphics-figures \"$GAME_DIR\" /tmp/fountain-figures 30 59 71.5 2400 0 -2048",
    "encoding": "The helper emits P6 PPMs. Encode gouraud.ppm, flat.ppm and unpowered.ppm as PNG without resizing, colour correction or filtering. The article displays pixels with nearest-neighbour CSS.",
